00:24.480 --> 00:31.280
but not lists, not sets and not dictionaries, which are themselves mutable.

00:31.280 --> 00:36.360
Unlike a list or tuple, sets can only contain unique items in them.

00:36.360 --> 00:42.480
If you make a set and you try to add items from the set, instead of a list where you can

00:42.480 --> 00:47.120
